<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Winter</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Yours Truly</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Too Late for Apologies</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1FDNvhoopE9r5BuhjOh88V</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.290" end="00:33.290">Woah, woah, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.570" end="00:42.800">Woah, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.800" end="00:45.830">They took the perfect picture</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.830" end="00:48.610">Now the glass is shattered on the floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.610" end="00:51.410">He swore he wouldn't miss her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.410" end="00:54.680">But cried a tear when she walked out the door</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.680" end="00:57.400">They tried but couldn't get it right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.400" end="01:00.550">His lies kept her up all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.550" end="01:07.650">And now it's over and there's nothing left to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.650" end="01:10.150">So take these memories</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.150" end="01:13.150">And say you won't forget me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.150" end="01:17.380">Someday you'll wake up all alone and I'll be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.380" end="01:20.120">The TV's on but no one's home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.120" end="01:24.720">These memories, I'll hold on if you let me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.720" end="01:29.030">Are all I have to get me through the cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.030" end="01:32.380">And now I'm gone and winter's here to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.380" end="01:40.380">Woah, woah, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.430" end="01:47.000">He set a good example</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.000" end="01:50.120">First class, a future football star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.120" end="01:53.030">But he took a different angle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.030" end="01:56.080">And now he's broke and living in his car</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.080" end="01:58.970">He tried but couldn't get it right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.970" end="02:01.950">She cried when he stayed out all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.950" end="02:09.190">And now it's over 'cause there was nothing left to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.190" end="02:11.530">So take these memories</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.530" end="02:14.570">And say you won't forget me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.570" end="02:18.860">Someday you'll wake up all alone and I'll be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.860" end="02:21.660">The TV's on but no one's home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.660" end="02:26.130">These memories I'll hold on if you let me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.130" end="02:30.450">Are all I have to get me through the cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.450" end="02:33.240">And now I'm gone and winter's stay here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.240" end="02:36.110">Now take your stupid poems and your sorry notes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.110" end="02:39.060">'Cause I don't care for heartbreak songs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.060" end="02:41.970">I don't care at all so don't call no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.970" end="02:49.970">I haven't felt the rain in oh, so long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.110" end="02:55.980">In oh, so long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.980" end="03:01.250">So take this memories and say you won't forget me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.250" end="03:05.710">Someday you'll wake up all alone and I'll be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.710" end="03:08.330">The TV's on but no one's home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.330" end="03:13.110">These memories, I'll hold on if you let me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.110" end="03:17.470">Are all I have to get me through the cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.470" end="03:20.690">And now I'm gone and winter's stay here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.690" end="03:28.690">Woah, woah, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.690" end="03:34.690" /></div></body></tt>